WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

This licence covers THE ENGINE: the code in js/, the stylesheet in css/, the
tools in tools/, the scene-script format, and the demo story and placeholder
art shipped in this repository.

It does NOT cover the artwork, story text or characters of "Aethelgard — The
Books", which are a separate work: (c) Dr. Sohil Momin, all rights reserved.
That game is free to play; its art is not open source.

If you build a game on this engine, your game's content is yours. The engine
stays MIT.
